{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "task.set",
    "description": "创建或替换持久化执行任务（Task）。Goal 与 Task 弱关联：有 currentGoal 时自动挂接，无 Goal 也可独立创建 Task。\n参数：必填 items（非空）；可选 title。每项 text 必填，status 可选 todo|doing|done（默认 todo），可带 expectedEffect、verification。\n同一 Task 至多一个 doing。替换当前活动 Task 时旧 Task 记为 cancelled(reason=replaced)。Task 跨 turn 持久。多数工具需先有活动 Task；本工具本身与收口/提问类工具除外。\n返回：ok、count、taskId。执行调度：serial（Runtime 固定，不必返回）。",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "reason": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "计划标题，可选"
        },
        "items": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "text": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["todo", "doing", "done"]
              },
              "expectedEffect": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "预期环境变化"
              },
              "verification": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "完成判据"
              }
            },
            "required": ["text"],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        }
      },
      "required": ["reason", "items"],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
  "execution": "serial"
}
